// dyn(2^192) -> ISZERO -> 0. 2^192 lives entirely in the top limb (limb3);
// a wrong limb0-only fold would see 0 and wrongly return 1.
PUSH32 0x0000000000000001000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x00
MLOAD
ISZERO
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x20
PUSH1 0x00
RETURN
